1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:42,380
[Episode 6]

10
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,540
This is

11
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,900
the Ascendance Sect?

12
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,180
What are

13
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,820
all these things?

14
00:01:58,230 --> 00:01:59,050
Your Highness,

15
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,980
they're humans.

16
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,380
So,

17
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,660
this is

18
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:07,410
human.

19
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:14,260
Welcome, Prince Ao Jia

20
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:16,380
of the East Sea.

21
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:28,060
Dragon Palace Envoy brings a message.

22
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,540
Master of Ascendance Sect.

23
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,410
Come at once to meet.

24
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:39,100
Who dares be so insolent?

25
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:41,730
So, you're

26
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,340
the Grandlord of Ascendance Sect?

27
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,170
Have you no manners?

28
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,780
The prestigious Ascendance Sect

29
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,570
isn't for a beast like you to question.

30
00:02:56,590 --> 00:02:57,690
How dare you!

31
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:00,010
This is the Crown Prince of East Sea.

32
00:03:00,150 --> 00:03:01,660
What are you to disrespect him?

33
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,660
I don't care.

34
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,130
Since you've come to my sect,

35
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:08,380
you must obey my rules.

36
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:10,170
Then let me

37
00:03:10,590 --> 00:03:11,850
teach you a lesson.

38
00:03:14,590 --> 00:03:15,380
Come.

39
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:18,060
If you can even scratch
one dragon scale,

40
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:20,850
I'll immediately kneel and swear fealty.

41
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,130
How about that?

42
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,500
Good.

43
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:42,260
Your Highness.

44
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:44,610
So, this is the Human Clan.

45
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:46,340
No need for you to step in.

46
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,290
Impossible!

47
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,570
Impossible!

48
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,450
I am a Celestial Immortal.

49
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,850
How could a beast defeat me?

50
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,980
Impossible!

51
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,250
Impossible!

52
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:27,810
You had enough fun?

53
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:30,490
Now,

54
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,810
it's my turn.

55
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:03,820
[Detached Master,
Grandlord of Ascendance Sect]

56
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:10,050
Breaths restored. Heavens as one.

57
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:12,050
Break!

58
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,100
Go.

59
00:05:50,190 --> 00:05:50,930
Your Highness.

60
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,490
Your Highness, are you alright?

61
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:59,700
The Human Clan is so despicable.

62
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,610
Let's not stoop to their level.

63
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:02,660
Are you alright?

64
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,460
Let me see.

65
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,660
I'm Detached Master,
Grandlord of Ascendance Sect.

66
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,980
Greetings, Crown Prince.

67
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,610
The proud dragon shall know regret.

68
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,140
Strength to the extreme brings disgrace.

69
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:16,490
I urge you to reconsider.

70
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:20,930
Mentor.

71
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,140
Mentor.

72
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,050
Mentor, you've emerged from seclusion.

73
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:29,610
Your Highness,

74
00:06:29,870 --> 00:06:31,220
His Majesty has ordered:

75
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,050
No trifles, no big trouble.

76
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:34,220
Yes, Your Highness.

77
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,660
We are

78
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,340
outnumbered.

79
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,140
Turn around.

80
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:42,900
Before so many people?

81
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,460
I don't need you to teach me how to act.

82
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:53,930
The proud dragon shall know regret, huh?

83
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:57,660
When you sought

84
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,140
to exterminate us,

85
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:00,660
did you ever regret it?

86
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:01,980
For nearly a thousand years,

87
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,980
you've dwelt in the four seas,
with strife unceasing.

88
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,460
Under the pretext of the tides,

89
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,170
you stirred up trouble.

90
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:10,220
For the bond between our clans,

91
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,930
we only gave a light punishment
as a warning.

92
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:13,780
We never tried to exterminate you.

93
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,610
A light punishment as a warning?

94
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,810
If you don't exterminate us now,

95
00:07:18,190 --> 00:07:19,730
you'll exterminate us eventually.

96
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,900
You humans always lie.

97
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,140
I won't fall for your tricks.

98
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:26,930
You've come with such a crowd,

99
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:29,340
just to engage in a war of words?

100
00:07:29,870 --> 00:07:30,730
A timely reminder.

101
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:32,810
Now, let us speak of business.

102
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,660
Some days ago,

103
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:39,290
you held a Training Assembly.

104
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,580
Many of our soldiers were hurt.

105
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:43,410
By all rights,

106
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:47,460
all who struck them should be seized

107
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:51,410
and punished without mercy.

108
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,460
Unfortunately,

109
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,250
my always speaks

110
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:58,490
of harmony between our peoples.

111
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,980
He told me not to stoop to your level.

112
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,730
They invite us to the East Sea

113
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:14,460
to settle this matter in three days.

114
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,140
The courteous words

115
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,580
have now been delivered.

116
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:18,660
In three days,

117
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,490
we shall meet at Dragon Palace.

118
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,370
Mentor,

119
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:35,700
we have no ties with Dragon Palace.

120
00:08:35,910 --> 00:08:38,010
I fear this feast bodes ill.

121
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:41,890
We must go. Courtesy demands it.

122
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,490
Besides,

123
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,850
if the peace between humans and dragons

124
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,650
falls apart because of us,

125
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,300
then in the future,

126
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:54,820
how can I face our ancestors?

127
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,100
The crisis has passed.

128
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,730
We'll decide the attendees later.

129
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,650
All divisions, you're dismissed.

130
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,890
Understood.

131
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:09,370
The invitation of the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea.

132
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:12,300
What a great chance!

133
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:16,250
I must guard the Sea-Calming Pillar
for the Celestial Court.

134
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,610
Greetings, Grandlord.

135
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:22,650
Come.

136
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,850
Quickly, rise.

137
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,730
Yuan.

138
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,300
You've been through a lot.

139
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:30,370
Look.

140
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,420
Wear it properly.

141
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:32,820
Yuan?

142
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,300
Who doesn't have a pet name?

143
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:42,370
Grandlord.

144
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:44,700
It's fine, it's fine.

145
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,460
Even when Mentor has nothing to do,

146
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,220
he still coughs up bottles
of blood daily.

147
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,180
If I could spit up so much,

148
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,610
that would be a true blessing.

149
00:09:52,750 --> 00:09:53,820
To expel the old and take in the new

150
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,940
is the true essence of the Way.

151
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,420
To expel the old and take in the new...

152
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,700
Yuan.

153
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,220
- How enviable.
- Grandlord, here.

154
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:04,460
This...

155
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:06,980
Coughing blood isn't expelling the old.

156
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,770
His body seems...

157
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,650
A minor injury.

158
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:14,420
These things happen.

159
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:16,770
My mentor taught me long ago.

160
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,340
I've gotten used

161
00:10:18,790 --> 00:10:19,650
to spitting up blood.

162
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,850
That's right.

163
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,610
- What teaching is this?
- I'm used to it.

164
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:25,730
Yuan,

165
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,700
if trouble ever finds you,

166
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,700
come to me for help.

167
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,580
Look, tighten your clothes.

168
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,460
You're all disheveled.

169
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,010
It's not proper before the juniors.

170
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,060
I won't look. I won't look.

171
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:38,610
I won't look. I won't look.

172
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:39,490
Fix your clothes.

173
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:44,530
What to do?

174
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,460
Sixty years ago,

175
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:48,940
you borrowed my Gnatsting Needle

176
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:51,850
to remove a nagging worry.

177
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:54,980
From then on, you were enlightened,

178
00:10:55,790 --> 00:10:57,340
advancing by leaps and bounds.

179
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:03,610
Now, a mere lackey of the Dragon Palace

180
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,610
can hold his own against you.

181
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:09,340
The Grandlord you most wish to topple

182
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:13,010
has become much more powerful.

183
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:16,180
Silence!

184
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:21,220
Only by growing stronger

185
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,370
can one be truly invincible.

186
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:28,340
We can give you

187
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:30,980
what your sect can't.

188
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,180
Be quiet! Enough!

189
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:39,250
There, there.

190
00:11:39,910 --> 00:11:41,460
My dear elder,

191
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,730
why not leave this sea of suffering

192
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:47,060
and reach the other shore?

193
00:11:48,510 --> 00:11:49,730
You should

194
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,490
simply convert to our side.

195
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,770
Look!

196
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:18,340
If the last Tribulation Cloud
was a false alarm,

197
00:12:18,870 --> 00:12:19,820
then this time,

198
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,370
this Tribulation Cloud seems odd.

199
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,730
A Celestial Immortal becoming
an Aureate Immortal

200
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,730
is a grand spectacle.

201
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:26,490
You don't see this every year.

202
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,060
Who would have thought

203
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:30,650
Kuai Si would pass first?

204
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,370
[Hall of Virtue]
If Mentor makes it,

205
00:12:34,510 --> 00:12:36,700
he could rival the Grandlord.

206
00:12:37,550 --> 00:12:38,460
More than that.

207
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,890
By then, our division

208
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,850
will rise in standing with him.

209
00:13:13,550 --> 00:13:14,010
This...

210
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:19,820
Congrats on becoming
an Aureate Immortal.

211
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:28,460
Elder Kuai Si quelled evil spirits.

212
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:30,460
His merit is complete.

213
00:13:30,630 --> 00:13:32,610
Let the 800 divisions celebrate.

214
00:13:40,270 --> 00:13:41,300
What now?

215
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:52,890
This is...

216
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:55,060
Had I not lost to the Dragon Clan,

217
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:57,130
I couldn't have reached this.

218
00:13:57,550 --> 00:13:59,060
I wish to attend the Grand Feast

219
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,580
at the Dragon Palace as well

220
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:02,100
to cleanse my past shame.

221
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,820
Grandlord, please

222
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,300
grant your consent.

223
00:14:09,670 --> 00:14:11,770
One alone can lead the banquet party.

224
00:14:12,790 --> 00:14:13,530
Okay.

225
00:14:14,670 --> 00:14:16,370
I'll have Wu stay.

226
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:17,650
You will go in his place.

227
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:21,100
Yes, Grandlord.

228
00:14:30,790 --> 00:14:33,180
I've helped you become
an Aureate Immortal,

229
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,890
and you've become my fellow disciple.

230
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:37,420
Time to offer a pledge of allegiance.

231
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:40,610
You must go to the East Sea on a task.

232
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:44,060
You'll be briefed on the specifics.

233
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,130
You

234
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,060
should just wait.

235
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:49,370
Who?

236
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,180
Uncle,

237
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:53,250
let me help you.

238
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:57,180
Why are you on the ship?

239
00:14:57,750 --> 00:14:59,850
You're not on the roster.

240
00:15:00,510 --> 00:15:01,850
Like you, Uncle,

241
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:03,250
I was added at the last minute.

242
00:15:03,790 --> 00:15:05,130
I was too scared to come.

243
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:07,130
But seeing the Dragon Prince so furious,

244
00:15:07,270 --> 00:15:08,250
after much thought,

245
00:15:08,270 --> 00:15:09,890
I still came, thick-skinned.

246
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:12,300
Really?

247
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,700
I can't hide it from you, Uncle.

248
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,060
I truly have selfish motives.

249
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:22,220
I want to see the Dragon Palace
and broaden my view,

250
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:25,460
so I could brag to the guys later.

251
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:27,220
But rest assured, Uncle.

252
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,820
About your reckoning
with the Dragon Clan,

253
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,060
I'll stand by your side

254
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,250
and cheer you on.

255
00:15:34,630 --> 00:15:37,890
You are truly an honest man.

256
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,100
But my affairs

257
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,850
are none of your concern.

258
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,610
You insist on wading into this mire.

259
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:48,770
Just don't regret it later.

260
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:49,940
Let me help you, Uncle.

261
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,850
Uncle.

262
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,490
Changshou.

263
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,180
I'm here.

264
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:57,370
Let go.

265
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,250
Stay out of it.

266
00:15:59,550 --> 00:16:00,220
Yes.

267
00:16:03,670 --> 00:16:05,130
Uncle, watch your step.

268
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:21,220
[Asura Cave]

269
00:16:43,550 --> 00:16:44,770
I've done

270
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,010
what needed to be done.

271
00:16:47,270 --> 00:16:50,650
Kuai Si now obeys me completely.

272
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,730
That should be enough for my report.

273
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:56,490
You've toiled for sixty years.

274
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,890
Cultivator, what a great service.

275
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,060
What cultivator?

276
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:06,140
Call me Queen.

277
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:09,180
Queen, you've done a great service.

278
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:12,140
I sincerely admire you.

279
00:17:15,070 --> 00:17:16,140
Jin Chan,

280
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:19,090
don't be so sarcastic with me.

281
00:17:19,350 --> 00:17:21,250
It's not that I'm stalling on purpose.

282
00:17:21,270 --> 00:17:24,460
The Way sects' roots run deep
in Central Plains.

283
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:28,090
Dragging them into this won't be easy.

284
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:29,900
My blood's almost run dry

285
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:32,180
from exhaustion.

286
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:34,090
And you...

287
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,900
You old stink bug.

288
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:40,380
You've been idling
in the East Sea for so long.

289
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:43,700
You haven't forgotten
the real matter, right?

290
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,570
Don't worry.

291
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,660
The hunter has cast the net.

292
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,050
Next,

293
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:50,730
just listen quietly

294
00:17:51,270 --> 00:17:53,620
to the moment blood is drawn.

295
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:15,740
[Jin Chan, Guest Official of East Sea]

296
00:18:15,750 --> 00:18:16,530
The pain is gone.

297
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:19,380
No matter what stubborn illness,

298
00:18:19,960 --> 00:18:21,420
it's no match for your blade, sir.

299
00:18:31,510 --> 00:18:33,250
Your Highness,
it's just pent-up emotions.

300
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:34,940
Even without seeking my help,

301
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:36,660
a few days' rest will drive it away.

302
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,570
I wish I could.

303
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,250
I don't have the time.

304
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:41,940
Speaking of which,

305
00:18:42,270 --> 00:18:44,010
those human scum are about to arrive.

306
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:45,490
Father leaves me

307
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,050
to host them all.

308
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,700
Then I'll give them a warm welcome.

309
00:18:51,750 --> 00:18:52,420
After all,

310
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,220
of all your teachings, sir,

311
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:57,050
I best remember one thing:

312
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,380
Humans

313
00:18:59,200 --> 00:18:59,980
and dragons

314
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:02,290
are sworn enemies.

315
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,420
No matter how many past grievances,

316
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,860
the humans are honored guests.

317
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:13,010
You must not breach etiquette.

318
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:15,050
Sir, you are truly merciful.

319
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:18,250
But didn't you teach me the principle

320
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,700
of courtesy before force?

321
00:19:24,070 --> 00:19:25,810
If there's no excuse,

322
00:19:28,590 --> 00:19:30,330
I will give them one.

323
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:34,530
You are frail, sir.

324
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,010
No need to see me off.

325
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:47,050
My heart pounds like a drum.

326
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:49,090
Truly,

327
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,940
most pleasing to the ear.

328
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:16,180
It looks like extra rations tonight.

329
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,250
Mind your manners!

330
00:20:30,350 --> 00:20:32,330
Are you the esteemed envoys
of Ascendance Sect?

331
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:33,220
Yes.

332
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:35,570
And who might this seafood be?

333
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:43,660
Who might you be?

334
00:20:44,030 --> 00:20:46,620
I am Jinli, the Dragon Palace General,

335
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:49,140
sent by the First Prince to welcome you.

336
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:51,330
Where is the Dragon Palace entrance?

337
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,050
The Dragon Palace has always had

338
00:20:54,350 --> 00:20:56,090
only one entrance.

339
00:20:57,830 --> 00:20:58,770
Are you afraid of water?

340
00:20:59,110 --> 00:21:00,180
Afraid of water?

341
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,490
Forget it. Too late now.

342
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:02,900
Open the Dragon Gate.

343
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,420
Fear-mongering.

344
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,290
Hold on tight.

345
00:21:18,830 --> 00:21:19,420
I...

346
00:21:20,310 --> 00:21:20,940
Changshou,

347
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:22,330
I thought you couldn't touch women.

348
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,700
Good heavens! Hold steady!

349
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:26,660
Hold on to me, Xuanya.

350
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:35,010
The Dragon Palace trip is so perilous.

351
00:21:35,270 --> 00:21:36,860
Senior Changshou, Junior Ling'e,

352
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,620
why must you come?

353
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,090
Exactly.

354
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:39,810
Changshou, are you okay?

355
00:21:39,830 --> 00:21:40,530
Senior.

356
00:21:41,110 --> 00:21:42,290
Are you okay, Changshou?

357
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,050
This is the Dragon Palace!

358
00:21:44,110 --> 00:21:45,730
How many treasures must be inside!

359
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:46,700
If you grab a handful,

360
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,860
you'll be set for half a lifetime.

361
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,420
We're here to broaden our horizons.

362
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,010
That's right.

363
00:22:01,500 --> 00:22:03,580
[Token]

364
00:22:13,510 --> 00:22:14,050
Senior.

365
00:22:16,820 --> 00:22:21,620
[Plaza outside the Crystal Palace,
Token]

366
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:24,860
Are you all right?

367
00:22:27,310 --> 00:22:29,220
Everyone, what happened?

368
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,530
Are you seasick?

369
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:36,530
We're here with goodwill

370
00:22:36,590 --> 00:22:38,010
for the feast.

371
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,700
Why make things difficult, Crown Prince?

372
00:22:41,160 --> 00:22:44,050
Elder, please don't take offense.

373
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:47,980
I'm the Turtle Minister of the East Sea.

374
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:49,940
It's quite obvious, isn't it?

375
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:54,530
The Water Dragon Spout is known
as the Dragon Gate.

376
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:57,770
Only our Dragon Gate Token

377
00:22:57,790 --> 00:23:00,460
and the Dragon King's direct descendants

378
00:23:00,830 --> 00:23:02,140
can open it.

379
00:23:02,550 --> 00:23:03,460
I have sent

380
00:23:03,790 --> 00:23:05,770
your little boat to the surface.

381
00:23:05,790 --> 00:23:06,770
It'll stay there.

382
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:10,570
When you ride
the Water Dragon Spout out,

383
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,220
you'll see it.

384
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,420
That's right.

385
00:23:14,240 --> 00:23:14,900
Everyone,

386
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,660
leaping this Dragon Gate

387
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,570
is a tremendous honor.

388
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:22,090
Without leaping it to enter
or leave the East Sea,

389
00:23:22,110 --> 00:23:24,420
you'd have to dive
through unfathomable depths.

390
00:23:25,110 --> 00:23:27,290
So, I hope you all

391
00:23:27,830 --> 00:23:29,570
can relax and open your hearts.

392
00:23:30,310 --> 00:23:30,940
After all,

393
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:33,810
the ground beneath your feet today

394
00:23:34,070 --> 00:23:35,380
is the Dragon Palace.

395
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:37,530
Enough, Turtle Minister.

396
00:23:38,790 --> 00:23:40,570
Don't make everyone stand while talking.

397
00:23:40,790 --> 00:23:41,980
I prepared today's banquet

398
00:23:42,790 --> 00:23:45,460
especially for the Ascendance Sect.

399
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,090
Come.

400
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,380
Please take the seats.

401
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,570
Kids don't drink.

402
00:24:49,310 --> 00:24:52,770
The Dragon King
called us to the East Sea

403
00:24:53,110 --> 00:24:54,700
to clear up the misunderstanding.

404
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:58,460
But where is the Dragon King?

405
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,380
Father

406
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:02,330
is indisposed.

407
00:25:03,270 --> 00:25:06,570
He bade me act in his stead

408
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,900
and receive you all.

409
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:10,810
The East Sea abounds in treasures

410
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:13,090
and rare delicacies.

411
00:25:14,030 --> 00:25:14,730
Everyone,

412
00:25:15,510 --> 00:25:16,860
please enjoy yourselves.

413
00:25:39,720 --> 00:25:41,010
I'll take them back.

414
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:57,980
Senior,

415
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,180
you won't eat any of these, right?

416
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:00,570
If not, it'd be a waste.

417
00:26:00,590 --> 00:26:02,180
I'll take them back for Mentor.

418
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:06,700
Seven.

419
00:26:09,110 --> 00:26:09,700
Eight.

420
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,250
- Nine.
- What are you counting?

421
00:26:12,790 --> 00:26:13,570
Junior,

422
00:26:14,550 --> 00:26:17,700
when we entered the Dragon Palace,

423
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,460
how many of us were there?

424
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,140
Our group had eight.

425
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,660
And you and I sneaked in.

426
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:25,050
That makes ten.

427
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:26,570
Ten from Ascendance Sect,

428
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:28,250
one Dragon Clan General.

429
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:30,180
So, the total should be...

430
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,010
Eleven.

431
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:32,530
No,

432
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,140
there are twelve.

433
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:37,980
Senior,

434
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:39,460
who taught you to count?

435
00:26:39,480 --> 00:26:40,770
It should be eleven people,

436
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:43,980
but there are twelve spiritual senses.

437
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,980
Don't look around; it's conspicuous.

438
00:26:50,030 --> 00:26:51,140
What does that mean?

439
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:52,290
It means

440
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,860
someone secretly tailed us

441
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:56,490
into the Dragon Palace.

442
00:26:57,310 --> 00:26:58,090
Who?

443
00:26:58,830 --> 00:26:59,730
Where is he?

444
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:14,490
I'm going to pass out now.

445
00:27:14,510 --> 00:27:15,290
Pass out?

446
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:16,010
Senior.

447
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:19,010
I'll pass out too then.

448
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:27,770
How is it?

449
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:30,570
Our poison

450
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:32,220
is no worse than yours
in the human world, right?

451
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:33,220
You poisoned us?

452
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,140
Why did you poison us?

453
00:27:35,350 --> 00:27:36,980
Why so harsh?

454
00:27:37,790 --> 00:27:38,980
This isn't poisoning.

455
00:27:39,790 --> 00:27:41,570
It's a test for all of you.

456
00:27:41,830 --> 00:27:42,770
A test?

457
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:43,810
Pah!

458
00:27:45,590 --> 00:27:46,460
This poison

459
00:27:47,310 --> 00:27:48,660
isn't exactly lethal.

460
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,140
It won't be fatal.

461
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:52,700
At most, just a deep sleep.

462
00:27:53,030 --> 00:27:54,140
Those with high cultivation

463
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:56,940
will neutralize it with their own power.

464
00:27:57,590 --> 00:28:00,530
Lower cultivation means faster sleep.

465
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:05,940
This elder

466
00:28:06,830 --> 00:28:08,620
seems to have decent cultivation.

467
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:15,050
Did you eat differently?

468
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:15,980
The same.

469
00:28:16,310 --> 00:28:17,620
My wine and food also have poison.

470
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:20,140
Then, why are you...

471
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:21,770
I am a dragon.

472
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:23,980
I was born with a sacred body.

473
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:25,620
Different from you humans.

474
00:28:25,830 --> 00:28:26,620
I'm not afraid of this poison.

475
00:28:27,750 --> 00:28:28,570
So you see,

476
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:31,380
compared to dragons, human bodies

477
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:33,050
are truly weaker.

478
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:36,770
Turtle Minister,

479
00:28:37,550 --> 00:28:38,980
quickly present the antidote.

480
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:46,810
Yes.

481
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:48,620
Zhenzhen, Ai'ai.

482
00:28:48,640 --> 00:28:50,220
Lianlian, Qiezi.

483
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:50,900
Apply the medicine.

484
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:02,700
It hurts.

485
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,380
And you are?

486
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:21,230
She is Jiang Si'er, Princess

487
00:29:21,230 --> 00:29:22,450
[Jiang Si'er, Mermaid Clan]
of the Mermaid Clan.

488
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:26,010
The First Prince's bride-to-be.

489
00:29:27,030 --> 00:29:28,730
Honored guests,
please don't misunderstand.

490
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:32,660
The Dragon Palace must stay guarded.

491
00:29:32,750 --> 00:29:35,620
All newcomers must face this trial.

492
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:37,570
- I'll go.
- We meant no harm.

493
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,490
The antidote was ready all along.

494
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:41,570
Please forgive us.

495
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:46,140
You released it too soon.

496
00:29:47,110 --> 00:29:48,490
I was just getting started.

497
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:53,660
At this point,

498
00:29:54,270 --> 00:29:55,660
the banquet may now come to an end.

499
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:58,250
Honored guests,
please follow the palace guards

500
00:29:58,510 --> 00:29:59,860
to your chambers and rest.

501
00:30:00,110 --> 00:30:01,810
Once the Dragon King recovers,

502
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,330
he will receive you all.

503
00:30:16,750 --> 00:30:17,620
Wait.

504
00:30:17,980 --> 00:30:21,540
[Ao Yi, Second Prince of East Sea]

505
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:22,980
Your Highness,

506
00:30:25,350 --> 00:30:26,050
you've returned.

507
00:30:26,070 --> 00:30:27,010
Ao Yi, hurry.

508
00:30:28,550 --> 00:30:29,700
Your Highness?

509
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:32,980
That's the First Prince;
that's the Second Prince.

510
00:30:34,590 --> 00:30:35,380
Everyone,

511
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:37,700
allow me to introduce him.

512
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,620
This young man

513
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:42,140
is Ao Yi, Second Prince

514
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:44,180
of the Dragon Palace

515
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:45,570
and my brother.

516
00:30:45,790 --> 00:30:46,180
Good.

517
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,180
Good.

518
00:30:49,510 --> 00:30:50,980
If his brother is this arrogant,

519
00:30:51,030 --> 00:30:52,530
what might the younger one be like?

520
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,770
He likely comes with ill intent.

521
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:57,770
Jia, about this rare banquet today,

522
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,380
I have a request.

523
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:01,900
Between us, no need for requests.

524
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:02,290
What is it?

525
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:04,420
I grew up in the Dragon Palace.

526
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:05,660
But

527
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,140
I've always heard that the Human Clan

528
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:09,010
has powerful magic and many heroes,

529
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:09,620
Jia.

530
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,050
Isn't this mocking us?

531
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,620
Even you caught the mockery.

532
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,010
Even?

533
00:31:16,070 --> 00:31:17,380
So, Yi, what do you mean?

534
00:31:17,750 --> 00:31:20,660
I want to take this chance to test

535
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:23,380
how strong human Qi refiners really are.

536
00:31:24,270 --> 00:31:25,730
That's my brother.

537
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,730
The true intention is revealed.

538
00:31:28,030 --> 00:31:28,810
Everyone,

539
00:31:29,270 --> 00:31:33,290
the Second Prince wishes to spar.

540
00:31:34,030 --> 00:31:35,530
Surely, no one will object.

541
00:31:37,310 --> 00:31:38,090
Senior,

542
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:39,980
you're so tall
that you might catch attention.

543
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:42,050
No, no, Your Highness.

544
00:31:42,070 --> 00:31:42,980
That won't do.

545
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,010
Turtle Minister,

546
00:31:44,480 --> 00:31:46,660
it's a just match for amusement.

547
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:48,090
His Majesty won't agree.

548
00:31:48,830 --> 00:31:50,420
Father gave me full authority.

549
00:31:51,680 --> 00:31:54,660
If I say a match, then a match it is.

550
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:56,770
I'll follow your lead.

551
00:31:57,920 --> 00:31:59,380
This height is about right, isn't it?

552
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,180
We're about the same now.

553
00:32:01,590 --> 00:32:02,860
Cover me, help cover me.

554
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:04,730
Come, Yi.

555
00:32:05,790 --> 00:32:06,380
Pick someone.

556
00:32:18,830 --> 00:32:19,330
Him.

557
00:32:22,240 --> 00:32:23,570
It really is you.

558
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:26,180
Me?

559
00:32:27,440 --> 00:32:29,180
No, he's too weak.

560
00:32:30,110 --> 00:32:30,940
You'll fight me.

561
00:32:31,030 --> 00:32:32,660
Xuanya will fight
in Senior Changshou's place.

562
00:32:32,680 --> 00:32:34,010
I'll go too.

563
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:34,460
She can.

564
00:32:34,480 --> 00:32:35,050
Me, me!

565
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:36,090
- Choose me!
- I can too!

566
00:32:36,110 --> 00:32:38,050
Me! I'll go too!

567
00:32:39,030 --> 00:32:40,050
What a racket!

568
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:43,700
It's up

569
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:44,980
to Yi.

570
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,180
No substitutions.

571
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:49,010
You're the one.

572
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:51,050
Come here.

573
00:32:52,310 --> 00:32:53,620
So, I can't get away with it.

574
00:32:57,790 --> 00:33:00,180
I'm Li Changshou
of Ascendance Sect.

575
00:33:00,240 --> 00:33:02,250
Greetings, Your Highness.

576
00:33:02,880 --> 00:33:04,010
Li Changshou?

577
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:06,700
My destined opponent.

578
00:33:07,510 --> 00:33:08,290
Destined?

579
00:33:09,680 --> 00:33:11,980
Have you picked the wrong man?

580
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:13,250
You are exactly who I seek.

581
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:16,380
You'll be the first stepping stone

582
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,700
for my grand cause.

583
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:25,010
It's a trap. I can't get drawn in.

584
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:26,010
When he strikes,

585
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:27,220
I'll fake getting hit and fly back.

586
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,050
Catch me.

587
00:33:28,750 --> 00:33:30,010
Rest easy.

588
00:33:30,590 --> 00:33:31,460
But what if you

589
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:33,730
land right on top of me?

590
00:33:33,750 --> 00:33:35,140
I'm using the One-Way
Voice Transmission.

591
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:36,290
I can't hear a word you're saying.

592
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:38,980
Then why did you reply to me?

593
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,980
Don't shame our sect.

594
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:42,140
Strike him!

595
00:33:50,310 --> 00:33:51,330
On my signal.

596
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,180
Now!

597
00:34:19,590 --> 00:34:21,340
Such formidable skill!

598
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:24,460
Well done, Changshou!

599
00:34:24,550 --> 00:34:25,420
Pummel him!

600
00:34:25,630 --> 00:34:26,130
Kick him!

601
00:34:26,150 --> 00:34:27,740
Changshou is so weak.

602
00:34:28,070 --> 00:34:29,530
How did he suddenly become strong?

603
00:34:30,150 --> 00:34:31,010
Senior,

604
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:32,530
why did you fight back?

605
00:34:32,590 --> 00:34:33,570
I didn't.

606
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,380
I thought you couldn't hear me.

607
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:37,170
I didn't touch him.

608
00:34:37,190 --> 00:34:38,010
Why is he acting

609
00:34:38,030 --> 00:34:39,340
as if I defeated him?

610
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:40,690
Could it be...

611
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:44,380
He repelled the Dragon Clan's
Second Prince?

612
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:46,780
Could he be hiding his cultivation?

613
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:50,380
Could he have really killed Yuan Qing?

614
00:34:50,670 --> 00:34:51,690
It's a trap.

615
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:55,210
Has he seen
through my hidden cultivation?

616
00:34:55,230 --> 00:34:57,780
And he wants to expose
my true cultivation?

617
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:03,980
I won't let you succeed.

618
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,650
Such a strong hidden force.

619
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,130
He really is still quite weak.

620
00:35:24,550 --> 00:35:26,260
I didn't touch him at all.

621
00:35:26,280 --> 00:35:28,340
The Dragon Clan power
is truly formidable.

622
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:31,820
Without touching me, it wounded me so.

623
00:35:36,190 --> 00:35:38,570
The Second Prince

624
00:35:39,590 --> 00:35:41,210
clearly took my attack

625
00:35:41,550 --> 00:35:44,820
yet is lively and unharmed.

626
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:47,650
I'm impressed.

627
00:35:51,630 --> 00:35:52,420
Good.

628
00:35:54,480 --> 00:35:56,650
Care to test my resolve too?

629
00:36:06,710 --> 00:36:08,050
So, this is the legendary spell

630
00:36:08,590 --> 00:36:11,170
of releasing power from the eyes?

631
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:12,940
Amazing!

632
00:36:13,070 --> 00:36:15,860
Our sect has no such move.

633
00:36:16,710 --> 00:36:18,010
My arm...

634
00:36:22,190 --> 00:36:22,980
is broken.

635
00:36:24,030 --> 00:36:24,820
See? It's broken.

636
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:31,380
You're going this far with me?

637
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:33,980
Don't doubt my resolve.

638
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:35,570
Fine.

639
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:41,740
You forced my hand.

640
00:36:46,120 --> 00:36:48,740
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

641
00:36:48,740 --> 00:36:51,560
♪Years splash ink♪

642
00:36:51,560 --> 00:36:53,550
♪Trekking far and wide♪

643
00:36:53,550 --> 00:36:56,860
♪Silent in subtleties♪

644
00:36:56,860 --> 00:36:59,600
♪The task descends on me♪

645
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:06,010
♪Though millions block, it echoes loud♪

646
00:37:06,010 --> 00:37:11,460
♪Transcending gods and demons above♪

647
00:37:11,460 --> 00:37:12,200
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

648
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:13,030
♪From the start, plan for storms♪

649
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:13,960
♪Seek refuge, survive, hide my skill♪

650
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:15,980
Save me, Uncle.

651
00:37:15,980 --> 00:37:17,050
♪Unyielding, who fates good and evil♪

652
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:19,210
I can't bear to watch.

653
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,980
Uncle,

654
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:23,380
save me.

655
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,460
Changshou!

656
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:28,380
Changshou!

657
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:29,170
First Prince,

658
00:37:29,190 --> 00:37:30,530
the outcome is clear. Stop this.

659
00:37:30,550 --> 00:37:31,650
Please, show mercy.

660
00:37:31,670 --> 00:37:32,610
Yes, yes.

661
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:35,420
Since the human is coughing blood,

662
00:37:35,630 --> 00:37:36,740
I declare...

663
00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:38,610
The fight isn't over yet.

664
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,380
No, I'll declare the Dragon Clan wins!

665
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:43,980
I never imagined that I

666
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:46,940
would meet an opponent like you today.

667
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:48,530
As expected,

668
00:37:49,280 --> 00:37:50,690
accomplishing great things

669
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:54,380
always requires the toughest trials.

670
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,090
Stop it!

671
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:57,780
I'll lose my life if you keep fighting!

672
00:37:57,840 --> 00:37:59,420
Compared to the Dragon Clan's future,

673
00:38:00,190 --> 00:38:01,090
my life

674
00:38:01,590 --> 00:38:03,090
is insignificant.

675
00:38:10,760 --> 00:38:11,740
Could this be

676
00:38:12,190 --> 00:38:13,820
the Human Clan's legendary Sword Flight?

677
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:18,300
I

678
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:24,980
hope my death

679
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,610
can awaken the Dragon Clan.

680
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:40,260
Bro,

681
00:38:40,670 --> 00:38:42,050
you're trying to kill me!

682
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:44,170
Let's see you keep this act up.

683
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,300
Your Highness!

684
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,380
Take him!

685
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:23,860
Your Highness!

686
00:39:32,150 --> 00:39:33,130
- Senior! - Changshou!
- Yi!

687
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:34,860
Changshou, Changshou.

688
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:37,300
Come on, help him up.

689
00:39:37,320 --> 00:39:37,820
Sure.

690
00:39:37,840 --> 00:39:38,170
Hurry, hurry!

691
00:39:38,630 --> 00:39:40,050
Why did it just happen again?

692
00:39:40,150 --> 00:39:40,940
Your Highness.

693
00:39:42,190 --> 00:39:42,690
Your Highness.

694
00:39:42,710 --> 00:39:43,380
Yi.

695
00:39:45,230 --> 00:39:45,820
Yi.

696
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,610
Li Changshou, how are you?

697
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:49,570
I gave it everything I had

698
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,610
but still couldn't defeat
the Second Prince.

699
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:54,130
I've brought shame to our sect.

700
00:39:56,030 --> 00:39:57,570
But he's already unconscious.

701
00:40:13,360 --> 00:40:14,130
You,

702
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:16,420
just put on a good show.

703
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:21,530
The Second Prince won so easily.

704
00:40:21,550 --> 00:40:24,300
He was overjoyed, which caused a stitch.

705
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,460
Is that so?

706
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:29,010
Yes, yes, that's right.

707
00:40:29,510 --> 00:40:30,570
Exactly so.

708
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:32,090
I declare

709
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:33,690
the Second Prince wins.

710
00:40:37,590 --> 00:40:38,380
Junior.

711
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,260
Senior.

712
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:41,980
You...

713
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:43,610
Junior,

714
00:40:43,630 --> 00:40:45,050
help me give the Second Prince

715
00:40:45,550 --> 00:40:47,170
a thumbs-up.

716
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,570
What does this mean?

717
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:54,260
To pay my highest respects
to the greatest rival

718
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:59,340
of my acting career.

719
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:00,420
Senior.

720
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:02,380
Senior.

721
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:02,980
Senior.

722
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:04,530
I couldn't make out a word.

723
00:41:42,020 --> 00:41:47,800
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

724
00:41:48,470 --> 00:41:55,170
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

725
00:41:56,700 --> 00:42:02,750
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

726
00:42:03,380 --> 00:42:09,830
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

727
00:42:10,570 --> 00:42:17,690
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

728
00:42:18,070 --> 00:42:24,970
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

729
00:42:25,350 --> 00:42:32,700
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

730
00:42:32,700 --> 00:42:39,870
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

731
00:42:56,010 --> 00:43:01,180
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

732
00:43:02,270 --> 00:43:09,290
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

733
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:16,420
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

734
00:43:17,120 --> 00:43:24,200
♪Alas, our story is short♪

735
00:43:24,540 --> 00:43:31,650
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

736
00:43:31,970 --> 00:43:38,450
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

737
00:43:39,230 --> 00:43:46,440
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

738
00:43:46,830 --> 00:43:54,650
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
